<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Ivona Meissner" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/ivona-meissner.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/ivona-meissner.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/ivona-meissner.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/ivona-meissner.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Ďakujem firme Protel za profesionálny support a inštaláciu!</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Ivona Meissner <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">BWH Hotel Group, Area Director Austria &amp; Central Eastern Europe </span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Miroslav Bukva" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/miroslav-bukva.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/miroslav-bukva.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/miroslav-bukva.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Vybrať do hotela vhodný software nie je jednoduché, pretože rôzne typy hotelov majú odlišné potreby. Pre veľký hotel s konferenčným centrom je robustné riešenie PMS PROTEL úplne ideálne. PROTEL je výborný ako z hľadiska výkonu, tak ceny a dôležitou samozrejmosťou je veľmi kvalitná podpora.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Miroslav Bukva <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Aquapalace Hotel Prague, General Manager</span></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-9-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-quote"><div class="has-icon left block-quote-figure"><div class="block-quote-image"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Michaela Bieliková" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/michaela-bielikova.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/michaela-bielikova.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/michaela-bielikova.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/michaela-bielikova.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">Protel je pre CPI Hotels vynikajúca voľba. Jeho intuitívne rozhranie, spoľahlivosť a efektivita nám umožňujú jednoducho riadiť rezervácie, spravovať hostí a sledovať štatistiky.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Michaela Bieliková <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">CPI Hotels, Director Of Training and Development</span></div></div></div></div></div>
